# Motorhead cine v1
# Sample for #151: RedRock, 8 AI cars, 15 s from the green light.
# A keyed fly-over of the grid (aim along the path, zoom keys), a trackside camera that shakes as the
# pack goes by, a dolly that keeps pace with car 7 through the first right-hander, and a slow-motion
# nose camera with a handheld sway that fades out.
Race Track 1 Cars 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 Difficulty medium Laps 3 Catchup on Start go
Output Size 1920 1080 Fps 60
End 15

Camera fly     path Drive time Aim tangent
Key fly 0 Eye 8 22 -70 Fov 70
Key fly 2 Eye 12 11 10 Tcb 0.3 0 0
Key fly 4 Eye 7 5 35 Fov 95

Camera gantry  static Eye 9 1.5 185 Target nearest Lag 0.05 Lead 0.1
Key gantry 0 Fov 45
Key gantry 3 Fov 100
Shake gantry proximity 3

# keys at metres of car 7's lap arc, 9 m outside the corner, 4 m above the car
Camera dolly   path Drive car 7 Target car 7 Lag 0.1 Lead 0.2 Zoom auto 14 Clear on
Key dolly 235 Eye 4.7 3.6 266.7
Key dolly 300 Eye 44.1 1.8 322.1
Key dolly 371 Eye 90.5 -15 372.9
Key dolly 443 Eye 127.5 -19.3 426.4
Key dolly 515 Eye 137.8 -19.4 494.5

Camera nose    mounted Target car 7 Offset 0 0.55 2.1 Hide on
Shake nose handheld 1.5

Shot 0 fly FadeIn 1
Shot 4 gantry
Shot 7 dolly
Shot 11 nose Speed 0.5 Pitch tape FadeOut 1.5
